data: {"id": "9df244ef939e4456-final", "run_id": "9df244ef939e4456", "seq": 833, "ts_ms": 1788765902434, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | 镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid DNS 解析失败导致容器运行时无法拉取镜像 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: {\"container\": \"app\", \"reason\": \"ImagePullBackOff\"}` (fact-96a98b4263bc) | 确认容器当前处于因镜像拉取失败导致的等待状态，是现象的根因定位点。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": rpc error: ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-accc6184a557) | 直接展示容器运行时尝试解析 `registry.invalid` 时遭遇的 DNS 解析失败错误。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Normal BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (fact-b9d9cd3f8bb7) | 确认 kubelet 已进入指数退避（Back-off）阶段，说明拉取失败已在持续发生。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-7556e7101d39) | 确认 Pod 未能进入 Running 状态，因容器无法就绪，符合拉取失败的阻塞逻辑。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason {reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"} = 1` (fact-7516f6177e85) | 从监控维度独立证实该容器目前处于 ImagePullBackOff 等待状态。 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-2) 提供了最完整的错误上下文，明确指出 `lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`，将故障原因锁定在 DNS 层面。这一事实解释了为什么容器状态 (fact-1) 呈现为 `ImagePullBackOff`，并且与 Metric 监控中的状态 (fact-5) 完全一致。由于容器未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 数据不可用，但这并不影响基于网络侧错误的诊断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nDNS 解析失败 (lookup registry.invalid: no such host) → 镜像拉取被拒绝 (ErrImagePull) → 容器启动失败并退避重试 (ImagePullBackOff) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n**根因结论：**\n已确认根因为**镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid` 的 DNS 解析失败**（证据：fact-accc6184a557）。\nPod 无法拉取指定的镜像，导致容器无法启动，进而使 Pod 阻塞在 `Pending` 状态并伴随 `ImagePullBackOff` 警告。当前证据足以确认故障机理，缺失的事实仅为节点具体的 DNS 配置内容（`/etc/resolv.conf`）以及该域名是否为故意配置。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 41.5s (Evidence 33.0s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.122, "metrics": {"run_id": "9df244ef939e4456", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.12887287139893, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 68128.87287139893, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 64000.500202178955, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_call